  "notes": [
    "Screen 2 uses the existing left-facing adult neutral sprite because no adult-determined-left file exists; inward-facing alternative is expressly allowed by Atomic 05 row 2. No asymmetric sprite is mirrored.",
    "Repeat tag uses an additional shared dark-ink token #0E1D14 to reach 4.752:1; all locked background and base ink tokens retain the exact specified values.",
